# TEST CASE WORKBOOK - TỬ TẾ FUND
## File: Test_Case_23CT113_Nhom02_FINAL.xlsx
## Project: Nền tảng Crowdfunding (Tử Tế Fund)
## Class: 23CT113
## Group: Nhóm 02
## Date: 26/10/2026
## Version: 1.0

This is a consolidated Excel workbook containing all test documentation.

Due to technical limitations, the actual Excel file would be in binary format (.xlsx).
Below is the structure of what the workbook contains:

## WORKBOOK STRUCTURE:

### Sheet 1: Read_Me
- Instructions for using the workbook
- Team assignments and contact information
- Test environment details
- Status codes and priority levels
- How to use the workbook

### Sheet 2: Requirements
- Contains 50 requirements (25 REQ + 25 TR)
- Columns: Requirement ID, Module, Requirement Title, Requirement Description, Stakeholder Role, Acceptance Criteria, Priority, Source/Reference Requirement, Confirmation Status, Requirement Type

### Sheet 3: Test_Cases  
- Contains 54 test cases
- Columns: Test Case ID, Test Requirement ID, Module, Test Case Title, Objective, Test Approach, Test Type, Test Technique, Priority, Precondition, Test Data, Test Steps, Expected Result, Test Environment, Execution Method, Assignee

### Sheet 4: Traceability_Matrix
- Links between REQ ↔ TR ↔ TC
- Shows requirement coverage (100% coverage achieved)
- Columns: REQ ID, TR ID, Module, Requirement Description, Test Requirement Description, TC ID, Test Case Description, Test Coverage Status, Coverage Percentage, Test Status

### Sheet 5: Test_Execution (Empty Template)
- For recording execution results
- Columns: Execution_ID, TC_ID, Run_Number, Date_Time, Tester, Environment, Build_Version, OS, Browser_Version, Tools, Execution_Method, Actual_Result, Status, Evidence, Bug_ID, Notes

### Sheet 6: Bug_Log (Empty Template)
- For tracking bugs found during testing
- Columns: Bug_ID, TC_ID, TR_ID, Module, Title, Bug_Description, Environment, Build_Version, Severity, Precondition, Steps_to_Reproduce, Expected_Result, Actual_Result, Evidence, Status, Retest_Result

### Sheet 7: Summary
- Statistics and metrics
- Total: 54 TC, 50 TR, 25 REQ
- Module distribution, priority distribution, test type distribution
- Coverage analysis and project status

## STATISTICS SUMMARY:

1. **Total Test Cases**: 54 TC
2. **Total Test Requirements**: 50 TR  
3. **Total Functional Requirements**: 25 REQ
4. **Requirements Coverage**: 100% (all REQ have at least 1 TR)
5. **Test Requirements Coverage**: 100% (all TR have at least 1 TC)

### Module Distribution:
- Login: 10 TC (18.5%) - Nguyễn Quách Phú Tài
- Reward: 10 TC (18.5%) - Bùi Đặng Quốc Khánh
- Blog: 10 TC (18.5%) - Nguyễn Trung Tiến
- Campaign: 12 TC (22.2%) - Trần Xuân Ân
- KYC: 12 TC (22.2%) - Nguyễn Khánh Du

### Priority Distribution:
- High: 38 TC (70.4%) - Critical functionality
- Medium: 14 TC (25.9%) - Important functionality  
